  "scope": "Controlled PAC execution for complete recovered NativeAnalysis fixed C prototypes with scalar, 128-bit integer, 64/128-bit short vectors, one-to-four-member nested/array HVA with full guarded return observation, record/HFA and original indirect record address operands. ABI recovery accuracy itself is not established by supplied IR fixtures. All five Mach-O routes require original exception classes. Declared memcpy CALL26 relocations are linked to a tested freestanding runtime; every other input instruction byte is checked unchanged in the final guest. Raw indirect calls are controls. Hidden results are qualified separately. Signed exception unwinding, authenticated whole-image execution, native Apple PAC and exact fault PC/full ESR remain unqualified.",
